{"translation":{"id":"ory_irv","name":"ଇଣ୍ଡିୟାନ ରିୱାଇସ୍ଡ୍ ୱରସନ୍ ଓଡିଆ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=ory","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=ory","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Oriya Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"ory","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"fe09301e6f43dbbcfcb30753438997976ee983751a3278733f551d91025dee13","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ଓଡ଼ିଆ","languageEnglishName":"Odia"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"ory_irv","name":"ଗୀତସଂହିତା","commonName":"ଗୀତସଂହିତା","title":"ଗୀତସଂହିତା","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"66539124e8124247ab4799343f0663cb93d027589d0e40219697891b1f630152","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":121,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ପରମେଶ୍ୱର ଆମ ରକ୍ଷକ"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ଆରୋହଣ ଗୀତ।"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ମୁଁ ପର୍ବତଗଣ ଆଡ଼େ ଊର୍ଦ୍ଧ୍ୱଦୃଷ୍ଟି କରିବି;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"କେଉଁଠାରୁ ମୋହର ସାହାଯ୍ୟ ଆସିବ?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ମୋହର ସାହାଯ୍ୟ ସଦାପ୍ରଭୁଙ୍କଠାରୁ ଆସେ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ସେ ଆକାଶ ଓ ପୃଥିବୀ ନିର୍ମାଣ କଲେ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ସେ ତୁମ୍ଭ ଚରଣକୁ ବିଚଳିତ ହେବାକୁ ଦେବେ ନାହିଁ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଯେ ତୁମ୍ଭକୁ ରକ୍ଷା କରନ୍ତି, ସେ ଘୁମାଇବେ ନାହିଁ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଦେଖ, ଯେ ଇସ୍ରାଏଲକୁ ରକ୍ଷା କରନ୍ତି,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ସେ ଘୁମାଇବେ ନାହିଁ କି ନିଦ୍ରା ଯିବେ ନାହିଁ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ସଦାପ୍ରଭୁ ତୁମ୍ଭର ରକ୍ଷକ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ସଦାପ୍ରଭୁ ତୁମ୍ଭ ଦକ୍ଷିଣ ପାର୍ଶ୍ୱର ଛାୟା।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଦିବସରେ ସୂର୍ଯ୍ୟ, କିଅବା","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ରାତ୍ରିରେ ଚନ୍ଦ୍ର ତୁମ୍ଭକୁ ଆଘାତ କରିବ ନାହିଁ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ସଦାପ୍ରଭୁ ସମସ୍ତ ଅମଙ୍ଗଳରୁ ତୁମ୍ଭକୁ ରକ୍ଷା କରିବେ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ସେ ତୁମ୍ଭର ପ୍ରାଣକୁ ରକ୍ଷା କରିବେ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଆଜିଠାରୁ ସଦାକାଳ ସଦାପ୍ରଭୁ ତୁମ୍ଭର ବାହାରେ ଯିବାର","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଓ ଭିତରେ ଆସିବାର ରକ୍ଷା କରିବେ।","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/121.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/122.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/120.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}